  "notes": "Output strapping schematic, not a full connector layout. M600 drawn as 48dB amplifier, -28dBm in on pin 8 (pin 16 the other input leg, unlabelled), +14dBm out on pins 3/11, feeding pairs of 300 ohm build-out resistors to outputs #1 and #2 (+8dBm 600 ohm, max output +18dBm). Note: 'FOR 1 OR 2 OUTPUTS (+8dBm 600 ohm) STRAP M600 FOR 600 ohm OUTPUT.' A second (left) diagram, cut off at the page edge, shows a board assembly of sixteen 300 ohm resistors feeding outputs #1-#8 (+8dBm 600 ohm, max +18dBm). Input polarity of 8/16 and output polarity of 3/11 inferred from the drawing order, not labelled."
